 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and self-characterizing: every new definition carries intro/elim plus its degenerate cases, bodies stay unexposed behind `(rfl)`-proved `_def` lemmas, and `private` is limited to steps a public form in the same file subsumes. General sign, gap, infinity-bound and squarefree facts are public in their own modules, automation annotations sit on the normal-form lemmas without looping, and there are no compatibility artifacts or duplicated declarations.",
